<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>Wanjiru walks from the school gate G along paths that run east to west and north to south: <m>{600}</m> m south, then <m>{600}</m> m east, then <m>{500}</m> m west, then <m>{100}</m> m north.</p><p>(a) Write Wanjiru's displacement from G as a column vector, in metres (east and north are positive).</p><div><fillin characters="3" name="ans1"/>  </div><p>(b) How far did Wanjiru walk altogether?</p><div><fillin characters="6" name="ans2"/> m  </div></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>Write each leg as a column: east and north positive, west and south negative. Then add the across moves and the up moves.</p><tabular border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center;"><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Leg</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Across (east)</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Up (north)</cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{600}</m> m south</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{0}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{-600}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{600}</m> m east</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{600}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{0}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{500}</m> m west</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{-500}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{0}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{100}</m> m north</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{0}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{100}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Total</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{100}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{-500}</m></cell></row></tabular><p>(a) The displacement from G is <m>{\left(\begin{array}{c} 100 \\ -500 \end{array}\right)}</m> m: head to tail, then from the first tail to the last head.</p><p>(b) The distance walked adds every leg: <m>{1800}</m> m. It is longer than the straight line from G to the finish.</p></p></solution>
    <answer><p><m>\left(\begin{array}{c} 100 \\ -500 \end{array}\right)</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>1800</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>